---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Structural Prototypes">
  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 2rem;">
    <h1>5 Structural Alternatives</h1>
    <p>As per Ticket 119, here are 5 structural alternatives for the secondary pages (/blog, /projects, /resume).</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/prototypes/alt1/">1. "Pokedex Screen"</a> - Hardware UI bezel, hinge nav, single content screen.</li>
      <li><a href="/prototypes/alt2/">2. "Trainer Card"</a> - 30/70 horizontal split, bold header, tight grid below.</li>
      <li><a href="/prototypes/alt3/">3. "Index / Roster"</a> - Minimalist text rows, no cards, hover reveals.</li>
      <li><a href="/prototypes/alt4/">4. "Dual-Screen"</a> - 50/50 vertical split, left sticky list, right reading pane.</li>
      <li><a href="/prototypes/alt5/">5. "Inventory Box"</a> - Bento grid, in-place Native Popover expansion.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
